{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429380/extras/42e6a6d819b61219f67e01674f8dbd31.avif?t=1773938718\" width=616 height=130 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Purchase Mercenaries</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruited from the shadowed halls of the <strong>Gladiator Den</strong>, mercenaries are born of chance.<br>Each one is unique, randomly rolled base stats, forged by fate, and marked by a single trait.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your soldiers gain strength through <strong>combat</strong>, levelling up as you march them into the abyss. Equip them with weapons and armour scavenged from the dead... or crafted from the remnants of things better left unnamed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Quest Run</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is broken into <strong>tile-based battles</strong> across a 6x13 grid. Most tiles will pit you against monsters. Others offer strange events that may yield rare items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden deep within each biome lies a <strong>secret dungeon</strong>, sealed behind a key. Conquer it, and you\u2019ll push into the next realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the journey through <strong>eight distinct biomes</strong>, each more twisted than the last.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sewer Run</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into the rotting underworld.<br>Face enemies armed with <strong>randomized gear</strong>, and push ever deeper, every 10th level summons a boss fight that tests your builds and your resolve.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bookies &amp; Casino</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gold has power, but risk rules this world.<br>Bet on AI-driven gladiator fights at the <strong>Bookies</strong>, or risk it all in the <strong>Casino</strong>, where rare treasures might await.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Colosseum</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter your own mercenaries into the blood-soaked <strong>Colosseum</strong>.<br>Victory brings glory. Defeat brings only the grave.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Loot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every weapon, every gem, every drop is a roll of the dice.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Primary Modifiers</strong> appear in <strong>light blue</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secondary Modifiers</strong> appear in <strong>blue</strong>.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429380/extras/29129de5c1c0e6243d3259b93e801fdf.avif?t=1773938718\" width=800 height=312 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crafting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Salvage the unnatural to forge the exceptional.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade equipment through found materials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Socket gear with <strong>Pearls</strong>, mutated relics containing three potential stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only one stat will transfer. Success chances are shown beneath each stat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose wisely. You only get one shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429380/extras/6a1d22dcc070b83b3efcec5a704329fa.poster.avif?t=1773938718\" width=800 height=626 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429380/extras/6a1d22dcc070b83b3efcec5a704329fa.webm?t=1773938718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429380/extras/6a1d22dcc070b83b3efcec5a704329fa.mp4?t=1773938718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Equipment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mercenary can be armed with their own arsenal of <strong>armour, jewellery, and weapons</strong>.<br>Every item features a <strong>unique sprite</strong>, rendered in grim, hand-drawn style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429380/extras/7fa6d8cc5973e342e3f80ebd1bb7282e.poster.avif?t=1773938718\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429380/extras/7fa6d8cc5973e342e3f80ebd1bb7282e.webm?t=1773938718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Kindred Ills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategy. Greed. Violence.<br>Your mercenaries will fall. But someone must push forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429380/extras/d2b3c0af1f1684e47e05f3cea6bf92aa.poster.avif?t=1773938718\" width=616 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429380/extras/d2b3c0af1f1684e47e05f3cea6bf92aa.webm?t=1773938718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429380/extras/d2b3c0af1f1684e47e05f3cea6bf92aa.mp4?t=1773938718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3429380?t=1773938718","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429380/a3ca2fa8a4299dbbba4f7ceb5fc6d33e227d42b7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773938718","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429380/1554824a7244d9ddee